**Summary:** A small polished browser game is done in \`project/index.html\` (zero-dependency, single file). You play a gardener astronaut running around a circular planetoid, collecting **8 glowing fruit before the 60-second timer expires**. Controls: \`◀ ▶\` / \`A D\` keyboard, plus large touch-hold buttons and drag-to-orbit on mobile. HUD shows live fruit count (with pop animation), countdown with bar + low-time warning, restart button (\`R\`), and mute toggle. Pickups give particle bursts, shockwave ripples, floating +1 text, screen shake, and rising synth chimes (WebAudio, no assets); winning triggers confetti + fanfare and a harvest-time stat, timeout shows a try-again card with your score.

**Play it:** open \`project/index.html\` from branch \`opencode/34010499304\` in any desktop browser — https://github.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/blob/opencode/34010499304/project/index.html (no build or server needed; file:// works).

